UID:a845c3d0c472976881f115fe0a876b@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Throwers\, tennis players\, fitness enthusiasts\, and anyone l
 ooking to keep their shoulders strong and healthy this FREE lecture at UVA
 C is for you! Learn from Dustin Allison\, PT\, from BE Fit Physical Therap
 y about the latest evidence-based strategies to improve shoulder flexibili
 ty\, strength\, and resilience while reducing your risk of injury. Discove
 r practical exercises and tools designed to support long-term shoulder hea
 lth\, enhance performance\, and keep you moving with confidence. Join us a
 nd learn how to build stronger\, more durable shoulders for whatever activ
 ities you enjoy! Please RSVP to confirm availability with BE Fit Physical 
 Therapy 802-359-7400 or Info@BEFit-PT.com.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
